      "seed": 1146405914,
      "version": 5,
      "versionNonce": 643701589,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785473996429,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Why add Sprint now?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Why add Sprint now?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Y4_3EJ5gn33I3sx4sJUXF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 673.0283528477696,
      "y": 18055.665984024046,
      "width": 1045,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3V",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 555648518,
      "version": 6,
      "versionNonce": 178499707,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785473996429,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Because almost every software company works in sprints (Agile/Scrum). By including it from the \nbeginning, we can later build AI features such as:\n\nAI Sprint Planner\nSprint Burndown Analysis\nSprint Summary\nVelocity Prediction\nDelay Prediction",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Because almost every software company works in sprints (Agile/Scrum). By including it from the \nbeginning, we can later build AI features such as:\n\nAI Sprint Planner\nSprint Burndown Analysis\nSprint Summary\nVelocity Prediction\nDelay Prediction",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ejkkUez0FI7W3s8Qio2F1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 604.3564778477696,
      "y": 18345.419890274046,
      "width": 407,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3W",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 485319692,
      "version": 7,
      "versionNonce": 654960821,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785473996429,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Can a user belongs to multiple teams?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Can a user belongs to multiple teams?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "fAw6njQ7uerDs57qUFZHo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 651.9931965977696,
      "y": 18377.177702774046,
      "width": 451,
      "height": 425,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3X",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 400759732,
      "version": 14,
      "versionNonce": 359524635,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785473996429,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Yes, a user can belong to multiple teams.\n\nLet's say you work at Google.\n\nYou are:\n\nBackend Engineer\nAI Enthusiast\nInfrastructure Contribut\n\nSo you might belong to:\nGoogle\n│\n├── Backend Team\n├── AI Team\n├── Platform Team\n└── Hackathon Committee",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Yes, a user can belong to multiple teams.\n\nLet's say you work at Google.\n\nYou are:\n\nBackend Engineer\nAI Enthusiast\nInfrastructure Contribut\n\nSo you might belong to:\nGoogle\n│\n├── Backend Team\n├── AI Team\n├── Platform Team\n└── Hackathon Committee",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "VOzfe66p1GDDHK7cPVZm2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 607.1142903477696,
      "y": 18927.177702774046,
      "width": 594,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3Y",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1034111924,
      "version": 8,
      "versionNonce": 798296597,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785473996429,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "This is exactly how you should think\nDon't memorize relationships. Instead, ask:\n\"Can this happen in the real world?\"\nIf the answer is yes, your database should support it.\nFor example:\n\n✅ Can a user belong to multiple organizations? → Yes\n✅ Can a user belong to multiple teams? → Yes\n✅ Can a project have many tasks? → Yes\n✅ Can one task have multiple comments? → Yes\n✅ Can one document belong to a project? → Yes\n✅ Can one user upload many documents? → Yes",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "This is exactly how you should think\nDon't memorize relationships. Instead, ask:\n\"Can this happen in the real world?\"\nIf the answer is yes, your database should support it.\nFor example:\n\n✅ Can a user belong to multiple organizations? → Yes\n✅ Can a user belong to multiple teams? → Yes\n✅ Can a project have many tasks? → Yes\n✅ Can one task have multiple comments? → Yes\n✅ Can one document belong to a project? → Yes\n✅ Can one user upload many documents? → Yes",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "oZEDAKNvNYtEq6hb-du76",
      "type": "text",
