      "text": "Part 1 (15 Minutes) Authentication vs Authorization",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Part 1 (15 Minutes) Authentication vs Authorization",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "bmvrmPbYTmk6HZ48VMh2m",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 828.9853840977696,
      "y": 6502.790984024046,
      "width": 671,
      "height": 725,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3j",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 913741845,
      "version": 81,
      "versionNonce": 1710949525,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785474194911,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "This is one of the most frequently asked interview questions.\nMany people confuse them.\n\nAuthentication\nAuthentication answers:\nWho are you?\n\nExample:\nUser:\nEmail = amit@gmail.com\nPassword = ********\n\nServer checks: Is this really Amit?\n\nIf yes : ✅ User is authenticated.\n\n\nAuthorization\nAuthorization answers:\nWhat are you allowed to do?\n\nExample:\nUser = Amit\nRole = Member\n\nCan Amit\nDelete Organization? ❌ No\nCreate Task? ✅ Yes\nInvite Users? ❌ Maybe (depends on permissions)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "This is one of the most frequently asked interview questions.\nMany people confuse them.\n\nAuthentication\nAuthentication answers:\nWho are you?\n\nExample:\nUser:\nEmail = amit@gmail.com\nPassword = ********\n\nServer checks: Is this really Amit?\n\nIf yes : ✅ User is authenticated.\n\n\nAuthorization\nAuthorization answers:\nWhat are you allowed to do?\n\nExample:\nUser = Amit\nRole = Member\n\nCan Amit\nDelete Organization? ❌ No\nCreate Task? ✅ Yes\nInvite Users? ❌ Maybe (depends on permissions)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ugN5uthWkvl1XYPyGdgTh",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 769.1142903477696,
      "y": 7315.177702774046,
      "width": 308,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
